[{"title":"胡伯玉隐趣图四咏 其三 岁寒亭","author":"陈樵","text":"夕陨悲蕣华，秋零悼蒲柳。\n急景不可留，高风邈难久。\n风霜十二月，松竹凋独后。\n还与岭上梅，结为岁寒友。\n草木本无情，犹能同岁寒。\n奈何市井交，轻薄不足观。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19512,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"胡伯玉隐趣图四咏 其四 竹涧亭","author":"陈樵","text":"脩竹荫幽涧，筑亭留隐君。\n隐君去已久，何人蹑清芬。\n抚弦变新声，感慨万古情。\n不识翁玉润，不识翁冰清。\n烟林暮萧萧，风水秋泠泠。\n故交难再得，兀肰空旧亭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19513,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"同陈子俊暮秋游耆阇山时九日后","author":"陈樵","text":"节季日月浅，山川凋落繁。\n志士惜迟暮，触事念虑端。\n同游得佳士，散怀逐跻攀。\n匆匆万夫内，乃有吾子贤。\n英特奇伟姿，笔精语亦温。\n暂远欣已遇，当忧亦为欢。\n步屧得古寺，入室清心源。\n草枯石色出，层构阴崖缘。\n猛虎昔夜吼，发石存幽泉。\n至今连筒饮，颇厌井汲艰。\n佳节去我久，黄花有馀妍。\n愔愔夕钟罢，草草尊酒残。\n客子已山际，落日犹树巅。\n举世尘漠漠，朗咏山中篇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19514,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宣和滕奉使茂实","author":"陈樵","text":"鸭绿少年骄不舞，大梁花石春无主。\n天与辽人十四州，四海九州非汉土。\n汉使相看堕节毛，乌鸟黑头羝不乳。\n旧时别赠杨柳枝，插向云中今十围。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19515,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"苏李泣别图","author":"陈樵","text":"祁连山下空弮折，啼鸟入梦头如雪。\n胡越相看十九年，今日输心为君说。\n穷兵未必来远人，居□□□□可驯。\n天骄万里来称臣，他年陛下知臣心。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19516,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送厉生之天台","author":"陈樵","text":"刘郎洞前药草肥，年年送春春不归。\n刘郎采药路不迷，路迷却是还家时。\n人间药尽采者稀，医师采药归未迟。\n终南捷径莫西去，正在刘郎路迷处。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19517,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠拆字蔡生","author":"陈樵","text":"至顺三年苦寒月，梅月不拆梅树拆。\n今日蔡家帘肆前，拆字拆作风花裂。\n书生贫病字撑肠，识字不识煮字方。\n字字拆来方可煮，煮作吴中菰饭香。\n我今林居交木石，妖祥祸福无留迹。\n六画吐尽一画无，岂复有字从君拆。\n古人作字留世间，因君破碎断复联。\n此术若在造字年，未成已拆何能传。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19518,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寒江渔乐图","author":"陈樵","text":"菰芦满眼沙际天，寒林古树凝苍烟。\n长河不是天上来，悬河滚滚生笔端。\n鱼龙半随风雨去，舟人渔子空茫肰。\n画师胸中吞万有，吐出云梦常八九。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19519,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"和杨廉夫买妾歌","author":"陈樵","text":"刘郎持玉笛，再入天台山。\n天台女儿不相见，采药直入桃花源。\n刘郎吹笛花能言，云离雨别三千年。\n青矑横波发鲜碧，蓝红染作夭桃色。\n刘郎今姓杨，相逢便相识。\n金条脱，龙缟衣。\n飙车木凤凰，飞下铁山西。\n茜桃拂面丹如雨，红蝶黄莺解歌舞。\n桃源无路入人间，一身金翠来何许？\n玉山子，莫将迎。\n方平会麻姑，参语无蔡经。\n飞仙不入风沙地，无端夜过昆山市。\n三涤肠，三洗髓，绛雪玄霜玉池水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19520,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"代嘲旧人","author":"陈樵","text":"吴王台前天地老，羊家吹笛烟花绕。\n羊郎到老不识颦，昨日西施颦更好。\n妾行自绾春风髻，姊送出门车在道。\n涂金两袖石麒麟，姊唾乾时碧如草。\n唾花一夜满妾身，云是背后悼夫人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19521,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"代答新人","author":"陈樵","text":"妾来咏柳三月初，美人未字杨柳枯。\n美人脉脉金芙蕖，不泣前鱼伤后鱼。\n阿娇黄金不复馀，白头曲成银笔书。\n曲成未用银笔书，相如明日刺相如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19522,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"代玉山子答","author":"陈樵","text":"建昌老父吹羌管，背花吹尽风花片。\n雪中花老花未知，我起开帘纳江燕。\n夏姬出境春争妍，房老不出金谷园。\n花奴鼓急人人顾，砑光帽滑花难住。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19523,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹隐轩","author":"陈樵","text":"绕轩修竹几百竿，潇洒迥若仙石坛。\n黄金琐碎夜月冷，碧玉萧瑟秋风寒。\n道人幽居坐其间，漠然尘纷不可千。\n劲节携为手中杖，散箨裁作头上冠。\n市朝富贵多忧患，山林旷荡聊盘桓。\n七贤清修诚足慕，六逸可学夫何难。\n有时梦见瀛洲仙，鞭笞鸾凤游无端。\n叩头再拜乞灵药，使我容貌无凋残。\n仙翁赠以九转丹，服之两腋生羽翰。\n逍遥物外有馀乐，何因报我青琅玕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19524,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"待月坛","author":"陈樵","text":"忆昔待月钱唐秋，眼寒桂树枝相樛。\n桂枝半蠹花不实，折之不得令人愁。\n帝乡幽燕邈吴越，还向山中弄明月。\n闻道君家待月坛，坛空风露何漫漫。\n便欲因之溯寥廓，倒骑玉蟾飞广寒。\n广寒宫殿殊清绝，素娥婵娟皎如雪。\n笑指桂树对我言，留取高枝待君折。\n待君折，须几时。\n明年八月会相见，付与天香第一枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19525,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天香台","author":"陈樵","text":"牡丹百本新栽培，累日为筑天香台。\n春风三月花信足，深红艳紫参差开。\n五色卿云色纷郁，九苞舞凤毛毰毸。\n也知东皇爱妩媚，何须羯鼓声相催。\n蔗浆初冻玛瑙碗，酒痕微污玻瓈杯。\n双成未逐阿母去，弄玉却伴箫仙回。\n还忆开元天宝时，沉香亭北君王来。\n霓旌翠节导雕辇，绣帷绮幄围香埃。\n倚栏只许妃子并，徵歌或诏词臣陪。\n陈迹如今安在哉，风雨满地唯苍苔。\n相传尚有清平乐，翰林供奉真仙才。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19526,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"蜀锦屏","author":"陈樵","text":"先生新辞白玉堂，晴昼衣锦还故乡。\n乡山草木被光耀，化作锦绣成文章。\n花神惊视不敢当，此花非我山中芳。\n初疑宠渥出秘阁，复道荣恩来奉常。\n云蒸雨湿春风重，至今犹自馀天香。\n愿将归院金莲炬，移近围屏照艳妆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19527,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题海棠","author":"陈樵","text":"东风吹堕缃云影，别院春迟宫漏永。\n绣帷宝带绾流苏，梦入瑶台呼不醒。\n荧荧银烛花蕊多，城头乌啼奈晓何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19528,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"石溪歌","author":"陈樵","text":"石溪一滴水，本自明河来。\n明河倒泻箕尾湿，千里万里喧风雷。\n小龙挟向云间过，水滑瓢攲误倾堕。\n苍崖一息裂清泉，似是巨灵新擘破。\n南州衲子天下奇，夜撑铁笛欲渡之。\n珠船照耀明月冷，赤手拾得珊瑚枝。\n又复扬舲向东去，直到众流归一处。\n东方火发海影红，金乌飞上扶桑曙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19529,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"香雪壁","author":"陈樵","text":"我欲借君香雪之素壁，障予山中玉雪之空亭。\n亭空壁素了无物，惟见虚白一色洞杳冥。\n宴坐契元始，忘世兼忘形。\n嗤彼尘俗人，两眼那能清。\n蓬莱之山仙子窟，玉作楼台银作阙。\n岂无瑶草弄朝烟，亦有琼花迷夜月。\n羽衣道士乘素鸾，引手招我青云端。\n翩然高举游八极，下视五岳烟雾何漫漫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19530,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题骑牛读书图","author":"陈樵","text":"朝看书骑牛，出去日上初。\n暮看书骑牛，归来日欲晡。\n朝朝暮暮看书卷，还虑牛饥无牧刍。\n家贫本分辛勤过，平时敢望閒工夫。\n人生衣食皆有馀，弃之不学将何如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19531,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"胡伯玉隐趣园君子池","author":"陈樵","text":"五月菡萏发，红妆明绿波。\n君看池上水，何似若邪多。\n若邪女儿歌艳歌，轻舟短棹相经过。\n倾城颜色有人妒，日暮凉风知奈何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19532,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其一","author":"陈樵","text":"田氏好兄弟，初焉念少差。\n一朝仍会合，荆树再开花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19533,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其二","author":"陈樵","text":"邺下然萁句，淮南布粟歌。\n相煎容不得，奈尔二人何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19534,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其三","author":"陈樵","text":"何苦毫釐较，当思手足亲。\n丁鸿与刘恺，让国是何人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19535,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其四","author":"陈樵","text":"鸿雁天边过，脊令原上飞。\n寻声还顾影，次序不相违。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19536,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其五","author":"陈樵","text":"父慈子必孝，兄友弟须恭。\n倘使诚心在，如何不感通。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19537,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其六","author":"陈樵","text":"连床听夜雨，长枕共姜衾。\n棣萼相辉映，何忧外侮侵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19538,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其七","author":"陈樵","text":"金昆与玉季，和乐奏埙篪。\n气象自然别，淳风复古时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19539,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其八","author":"陈樵","text":"生来同一气，兄弟是天伦。\n祇要长和睦，休论富与贫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19540,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其九","author":"陈樵","text":"友爱言无间，从教耳属垣。\n怡愉崇逊让，宽厚福之源。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19541,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"劝兄弟 其十","author":"陈樵","text":"古有难兄弟，今无好弟兄。\n何由风俗厚，凡百近人情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19542,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新凉 其一","author":"陈樵","text":"夜来窗户凉，一枕听秋雨。\n晓起绝飞埃，门前有流水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19543,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新凉 其二","author":"陈樵","text":"雨将残暑去，风送新凉至。\n安得归梦成，长夜愁不寐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19544,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"芦雁四咏飞鸣宿食 其一","author":"陈樵","text":"肃羽遵寒渚，渡江芦叶黄。\n谁云南去远？\n不敢过衡阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19545,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"芦雁四咏飞鸣宿食 其二","author":"陈樵","text":"万里西风急，送书时一声。\n从教惊客梦，可待主人烹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19546,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"芦雁四咏飞鸣宿食 其三","author":"陈樵","text":"沙汀栖处稳，夜漏有奴看。\n月暗芦花白，一身秋梦寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19547,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"芦雁四咏飞鸣宿食 其四","author":"陈樵","text":"饮啄殊自得，水田稻粱秋。\n宁因谋一饱，失却网罗忧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19548,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其一 飞来山","author":"陈樵","text":"宝林从何来，飞空锡同住。\n天风吹海涛，常恐复飞去。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19549,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其二 应天塔","author":"陈樵","text":"浮图成再世，嶪岌高入云。\n妙应人天果，铃音上界闻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19550,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其三 灵鳗井","author":"陈樵","text":"岩穴如深井，滋润通海脉。\n灵鳗久蜿蜒，岁事时有获。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19551,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其四 罗汉泉","author":"陈樵","text":"应真曾卓锡，百尺井泉深。\n汲取天人供，泓澄印佛心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19552,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其五 大布衣","author":"陈樵","text":"河凉大布衲，七帝师道德。\n流传五百年，未灭针线迹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19553,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其六 古铁钵","author":"陈樵","text":"铁钵生古色，曾经饭胡麻。\n黄龙此降伏，更长碧莲花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19554,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其七 深竹堂","author":"陈樵","text":"禅宫庭宇静，深翠万竿竹。\n忽悟瓦砾声，香严道机熟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19555,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"越上宝林寺八咏 其八 盘翠轩","author":"陈樵","text":"轩楹越中秀，轩窗四面山。\n红尘飞不到，长共白云閒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19556,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"陈樵","text":"今年尽今日，明日是明年。\n客况萧条处，春寒雪后天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","