:"陈樵","text":"广平新职业，荆楚旧文章。\n盛府芙蓉幕，诸曹雁鹜行。\n宾僚严分限，官事举维纲。\n千里无青草，饥民正可伤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"投宪幕上下 其三","author":"陈樵","text":"颜巷端居日，膺门属望初。\n芙蓉池不远，桃李地无馀。\n霜雪归行幕，星辰近辅车。\n不才污盛府，吾子意何如。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"投宪幕上下 其四","author":"陈樵","text":"法曹新政绩，宪府旧才贤。\n下客初倾盖，东州共拂冠。\n无才供几案，有术事虚玄。\n柱下非明习，吾知济世难。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"投宪幕上下 其五","author":"陈樵","text":"声名沈书记，廉白杜参军。\n千里风期合，三才月旦尊。\n辞章须尔雅，帏幄厌深文。\n秋兴知多少，黄花酒满樽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"投宪幕上下 其六","author":"陈樵","text":"求学乡人久，为农岁序更。\n三秋收橡栗，千里足莼羹。\n作吏真痴绝，吟诗得瘦生。\n诸公能指画，经训尚纵横。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":19580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]